    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d144">

                <pb facs="1164" n="1006" sameAs="frus:frus1906p2/pg1006"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Japanese Chargé to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Japanese Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-04-25"><hi rendition="#italic">April 25,
                        1906</hi>.</date></dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 24.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inform you that
                    Viscount Siuzo Aoki, who has been appointed by His Majesty the Emperor of Japan
                    to be his ambassador extraordinary and plenipotentiary near the Government of
                    the United States, has arrived in Washington yesterday.</p>
                <p>I beg leave to request that you will be so good as to appoint a time when he may
                    call at the Department of State to pay his respects to you and to make
                    arrangements with, you for the presentation of his credentials to the
                    President.</p>
                <p>Accept, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Eki Hioki.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
